69
00:12:06,527 --> 00:12:13,827
<i>I could have got through anytime</i>

70
00:12:13,827 --> 00:12:21,537
<i>Cold lonely puritan</i>

71
00:12:21,537 --> 00:12:29,257
<i>What are you fighting for?</i>

72
00:12:29,257 --> 00:12:36,427
<i>It's not my security</i>

73
00:12:36,427 --> 00:12:40,227
<i>It's just an old war</i>

74
00:12:40,227 --> 00:12:43,727
<i>Not even a cold war</i>

75
00:12:43,727 --> 00:12:47,817
<i>Don't say it in Russian</i>

76
00:12:47,817 --> 00:12:51,567
<i>Don't say it in German</i>

77
00:12:51,567 --> 00:13:07,377
<i>Just say it in broken English</i>

78
00:13:15,887 --> 00:13:24,097
<i>Lose your father your husband</i>

79
00:13:24,097 --> 00:13:31,817
<i>Your mother your children</i>

80
00:13:31,817 --> 00:13:39,947
<i>What are you fighting for?</i>

81
00:13:39,947 --> 00:13:46,707
<i>It's not my reality</i>

82
00:13:46,707 --> 00:13:50,297
<i>It's just an old war</i>

83
00:13:50,297 --> 00:13:54,177
<i>Not even a cold war</i>

84
00:13:54,177 --> 00:13:58,097
<i>Don't say it in Russian</i>

85
00:13:58,097 --> 00:14:02,017
<i>Don't say it in German</i>

86
00:14:02,017 --> 00:14:17,527
<i>Just say it in broken English</i>

87
00:21:57,277 --> 00:22:07,277
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>

88
00:22:29,477 --> 00:22:33,397
<i>Soldiers march down the street in ranks</i>

89
00:22:33,397 --> 00:22:37,407
<i>to wage war on a distant enemy</i>

90
00:22:37,407 --> 00:22:41,487
<i>In a time gone mad,</i>

91
00:22:41,487 --> 00:22:49,287
<i>they keep on walking, just to die</i>

92
00:22:49,287 --> 00:22:59,287
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>

93
00:23:05,427 --> 00:23:09,397
<i>Who knows what is at work</i>
<i>deep down in their hearts?</i>

94
00:23:09,397 --> 00:23:13,437
<i>It's too dark in there to see anything</i>

95
00:23:13,437 --> 00:23:17,647
<i>Standing in a windswept field</i>

96
00:23:17,647 --> 00:23:25,497
<i>counting up the number of bodies</i>

97
00:23:41,427 --> 00:23:45,387
<i>The soldiers in the square</i>
<i>dance around in a circle</i>

98
00:23:45,387 --> 00:23:49,517
<i>But they don't have time to do so</i>

99
00:23:49,517 --> 00:23:53,517
<i>Not if they're going to make their escape</i>

100
00:23:53,517 --> 00:23:57,357
<i>Not if they're going to prolong their lives</i>

101
00:23:57,357 --> 00:24:01,277
<i>From a clock tower at the end of the world</i>

102
00:24:01,277 --> 00:24:05,407
<i>a rotten shadow watches</i>

103
00:24:05,407 --> 00:24:09,367
<i>as they fall upon the crimson field,</i>

104
00:24:09,367 --> 00:24:17,757
<i>with arms folded, folded, folded</i>
<i>(arms folded, folded folded)</i>

105
00:24:17,757 --> 00:24:21,297
<i>and laughs</i>

106
00:24:25,177 --> 00:24:41,527
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>
<i>The Devil's Stocking (doo doo bee doo)...</i>

107
00:24:41,527 --> 00:24:45,447
<i>Soldiers march down the street in ranks</i>

108
00:24:45,447 --> 00:24:49,497
<i>to wage war on a distant enemy</i>

109
00:24:49,497 --> 00:24:53,577
<i>In a time gone mad,</i>

110
00:24:53,577 --> 00:25:01,677
<i>they keep on walking, just to die</i>

111
00:25:01,677 --> 00:25:11,667
<i>They keep on walking... They keep on walking...</i>

